{
    "0": {
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A vampire’s mansion standing closely by the lakeside."
            ]
        },
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Sakuya  $Remilia  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Scarlet Devil Mansion."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Sakuya  >An incident? Did something truly happen?"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >You didn't notice?"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was like time itself had stopped."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Right, milady?"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Sakuya  >It can't be, stopping time? There's no way something like that's even remotely possible."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Remilia  >Oh, Reimu. That stone you're holding..."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >You made this thing, didn't you?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I managed to solve the incident thanks to it."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Remilia  >Hm... I've never see that stone before."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Don't lie to me, it has the same aura as the Scarlet Mist Incident!"
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Remilia  >Speaking of, you were spouting some nonsense about an incident before... What was it?"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Wha—you also didn't notice?"
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was like time completely stopped all over Gensokyo!"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Remilia  >Time stopped? Ah, the culprit must've been Sakuya then."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >If only it could've been that simple..."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Sakuya  >\"Simple\", you say? Shall I demonstrate how \"simple\" I truly am?"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >That's not what I mean, it wasn't just the enemy's strength.",
                "<l$> This incident was just truly incomprehensible..."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Remilia  >My interest is piqued... What kind of incident was it?"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Reimu told Remilia and the others of what had transpired."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She was relieved in the face of familiarity."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just as Ariya said, there weren't any noticeable changes."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems that the residents of the Scarlet Devil Mansion aren't involved this time after all."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, this Incident Stone obviously held the youkai aura of the Scarlet Devil Mansion."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It is undeniable that it was thanks to this Incident Stone that the influence of the goddess of unchanging was staved off."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She felt that there was still something she didn't know about yet lurking in the shadows."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No. 01 — The Everyday Scarlet Devil Mansion$>"
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}